<p style="margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; color:#0c5a53; font-size:16.0px">अस्त्यस्यस्मीत्येवमादि<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>सुलभं<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>तत्क्रियापदम्<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>॥<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>६५<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>॥</p>
<p style="margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; color:#0c5a53; font-size:16.0px"><br></p>
<p style="margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; color:#0c5a53; font-size:16.0px">कर्मवाक्येष्विवैतेषु<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>वेदान्तेष्वनपेक्षता<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>॥</p>
<p style="margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; color:#0c5a53; font-size:16.0px">नान्यत्रापेक्षितुं<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>योग्यं<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>सरित्तीरफलोक्तिवत्<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>॥<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>६६<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>॥</p>
