<p style="margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; color:#0c5a53; font-size:16.0px">फलानि<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>चक्षुयोग्यानि<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>योग्यं<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>ब्रह्म<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>तु<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>कस्य<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>ते<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>॥</p>
