<p style="margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; color:#0c5a53; font-size:16.0px">यत्राप्यातिशयो<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>दृष्टः<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>स<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>स्वार्थानतिलङ्घनात्<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>॥</p>
