<p style="margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; color:#48b3ff; font-size:8.7px">वक्तव्यम्<span style="font-size:8.7px">, </span>असत्यस्य<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>वाष्पादेः<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>सम्यग्धीजनकत्वादृष्टेः<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>तथाचा<span style="font-size:8.7px">-</span></p>
<p style="margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; color:#48b3ff; font-size:8.7px">द्वैतहानिरिति<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>तत्राह<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span><span style="font-size:8.7px">※</span>अविचारितेति<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>।<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span><span style="font-size:8.7px">※</span>इतरेति<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>।<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>स्वमव्यव<span style="font-size:8.7px">-</span></p>
<p style="margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; color:#48b3ff; font-size:8.7px">हारविदित्यर्थे<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>।<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>नच<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>सत्यस्यैव<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>प्रमाजनकत्वनियमः<span style="font-size:8.7px">, </span>वाष्पा<span style="font-size:8.7px">-</span></p>
<p style="margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; color:#48b3ff; font-size:8.7px">दिजन्यधियोऽपि<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>विषयावाधप्रमात्वाङ्गीरादिति<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>भावः<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>॥<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>८०॥</p>
<p style="margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; color:#48b3ff; font-size:8.7px">शास्त्रावैयर्थ्यमुपसंहरति<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span><span style="font-size:8.7px">※</span>अव्युत्पात्तिरिति<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>॥<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>८१<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>॥<span style="font-size:8.7px"> '</span>श्रोतव्यः<span style="font-size:8.7px">' </span>इति<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>वाक्यं<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>व्याचिख्यासुस्तदुपयोगित्वेन<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>विद्यासूत्रार्थमुक्तं<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>स्मारयति<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span><span style="font-size:8.7px">※</span>आत्मेति<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>॥<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>८२<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>॥<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>तत्र<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>प्रथमव्याख्यानुसारेण<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>द्रष्टव्यवाक्यं<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>प्रतृतं<span style="font-size:8.7px">, </span>द्वितीयव्याख्यानुसारे<span style="font-size:8.7px">-</span></p>
<p style="margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; color:#48b3ff; font-size:8.7px">ण<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>श्रोतव्यवाक्यप्रतृतिरित्याह<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span><span style="font-size:8.7px">※</span>आत्मेति<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>॥<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>८३<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>॥<span style="font-size:8.7px"> </span>एवं</p>
