<p style="margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; color:#0c5a53; font-size:16.0px">अर्थासम्भावनोच्छेदी<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>तर्को<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>मननमीरितम्<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>॥</p>
<p style="margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; color:#0c5a53; font-size:16.0px">वेदशास्त्राविरोध्यत्र<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>तर्को<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>ग्राह्यो<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>न<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>चेतरः<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>॥<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>८५<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>॥</p>
