<p style="margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; color:#0c5a53; font-size:16.0px">ध्यानाशङ्कानिवृत्त्यर्थं<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>विज्ञानेनेत्युदीरणात्<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>॥<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>८६<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>॥</p>
