<p style="margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; color:#0c5a53; font-size:16.0px">यावद्यथोक्तं<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>विज्ञानमाविर्भवति<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>भास्वरम्<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>॥<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>८८<span style="font-size:16.0px"> </span>॥</p>
